OL,3,GNEWSAThe fruit crossing continents and
OL,4,Acultures
OL,5,
OL,6,FVans stacked with crates of juicy, ripe
OL,7,Fmangoes have become a familiar sight on
OL,8,Fmany streets in Yorkshire this summer
OL,9,Fas shoppers bustle to make the most of
OL,10,Fthe current peak season for prized
OL,11,Fvarieties.
OL,13,FBut behind the roadside spectacle is a
OL,14,Fsignificant seasonal economy stretching
OL,15,F4,000 miles across continents, and a
OL,16,Fdeeper culinary heritage story spread
OL,17,Facross generations.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
