OL,3,GNEWSAThe fruit crossing continents and
OL,4,Acultures
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt South Asian supermarkets across West
OL,7,FYorkshire, hundreds of boxes a day of
OL,8,Fthe "king of fruits" are flying off the
OL,9,Fshelves, with importers, wholesalers,
OL,10,Fdrivers, grocers and dessert shops all
OL,11,Fsharing in the rush.
OL,13,FSatvir Meen, of the Yorkshire Asian
OL,14,FBusiness Association, explains: "Mango
OL,15,Fseason is hugely important, and across
OL,16,FYorkshire for a lot of retailers it's
OL,17,Fone of the biggest seasonal trading
OL,18,Fperiods of the year."
